=== SURVEY ===
Inspected alert rule handler, typed alert model, rule engine, rule engine tests, telemetry alert evaluator, metrics declarations, alert repository, worker polling alert path, signal catalog repository, and static known signal names.
Found legacy leaks: CreateRule defaulted severity to warning; create/update accepted legacy fields and unvalidated op/severity operands; TestRule accepted notify_channels and defaulted message; RuleEngine still built models.RuleCondition and evaluated legacy operators; models.RuleCondition remained only for the alert-rule engine; telemetry logs/metrics help still used CEP wording; worker polling alert path still used threshold terminology and only a narrow snake_case signal subset.

=== REASONING ===
Production clean-slate from Prompt 00 allows forward-only typed enforcement with no legacy payload preservation. The handler now rejects legacy alert-rule fields before persistence, validates final create/update models against typed op/severity/operand rules, rejects unknown signal_name values when signal_catalog loads, and falls back to strict operand-shape validation only when the catalog cannot be loaded.
The evaluator now reads typed AlertRule columns directly instead of rebuilding condition trees. changed rules retain restart baseline behavior and are the only rules whose cooldown resets when the condition becomes false. Prometheus metric Name values are preserved while Go identifiers/help text move to typed alert-rule wording.

=== CHANGES ===
Updated internal\api\alert_handler.go with typed JSON field decoders, forbidden legacy field rejection, strict severity/op/operand validation, signal catalog checks, create defaults (severity warn, cooldown_min 15, enabled true), nullable update handling, and /alerts/test message + typed target DTO support.
Updated internal\api\rule_engine.go to evaluate typed AlertRule fields directly, remove legacy transition/string/bool pseudo-ops, preserve changed restart baseline state, and reset cooldowns only for op == changed.
Updated internal\api\rule_engine_test.go for typed changed/range behavior only and added internal\api\alert_handler_test.go for strict severity, forbidden legacy payload, create defaults, operand validation, and typed test target parsing.
Updated internal\api\telemetry_alerts.go and internal\metrics\metrics.go terminology while preserving exported Prometheus metric names.
Removed models.RuleCondition from internal\models\models.go because no production code uses it after the evaluator refactor.
Updated internal\worker\worker.go polling alert evaluation to use typed signal names, typed operands, and typed event payload fields without type/threshold rule fields.
